      "description": "As a software engineer in the iOS Web Services team at Apple, I developed and maintained web services and applications for use by iOS engineers. Through this position, I have learned SproutCore, native Mac app development, and Sinatra. I also designed the REST web service API for the bug tracking system (Radar) used by the entire company.",
