      "totalDuration": "6 yrs",
      "description": "At Apple, I have maintained, redesigned, and transitioned the CrashTracer system for analyzing and data mining application crash reports. My responsibilities center around the front end of the system -- to this end, I have contributed to UI design, schema design, data modeling, and optimization of a website used throughout the OS engineering division. Most notably, I transitioned a large website using PHP to Ruby on Rails.",
